        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_eda79f7f33eb4adea99ea6a351128b06",
      "statement": "At YE2025 the reported EVE change is +$2,737.4mm (+2.47% of Tier 1) at -200 bp, +$1,368.7mm (+1.24%) at -100 bp, -$1,368.7mm (-1.24%) at +100 bp and -$2,737.4mm (-2.47%) at +200 bp, all within limit; the Annual Report and Pillar 3 disclose these rounded.",
