      "id": "claim_2d058cba8fdb415c8826a181254114f6",
      "statement": "The Board Risk Committee limit (approved 2025-03) is an EVE decline of no more than 15.0% of Tier 1 capital; the Summary sheet flags BREACH only when EVE % of Tier 1 falls below -15% in any scenario, and Pillar 3 reports 2.5% against it for +200 bp.",
